    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Carroll are delighted to bring No 51 Marlmount Park to the market, a stunningly presented four bedroom semi detached family home offering a wealth of fine finishes and features. \n\nMarlmount is an exceptional development of exclusive family homes located in a privileged setting to the south of Dundalk on the Old Dublin Road, a short distance from the seaside village of Blackrock, Dundalk town centre and with easy access to the M1 Motorway. \n\nA welcoming four bedroom semi detached 'Hazel' style family home, extending to c.1,292 sq ft offering generous and light filled living including, entrance hall, sitting room, kitchen/dining room, utility and WC at ground floor. Upstairs there are four generous bedrooms with master en-suite and family bathroom. \n\nA turn key home filled with quality fittings that is sure to appeal to a wide range of discerning purchasers, viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGROUND FLOOR - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - \n\n\nSitting Room - \n\n\nKitchen Dining Room - \n\n\nUtility Room - \n\n\nWC - \n\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - \n\n\nEn-Suite - \n\n\nBedroom 2 - \n\n\nBedroom 3 - \n\n\nBedroom 4 - \n\n\nBathroom - \n\n\n - \nTOTAL FLOOR AREA:120 sq.m. (1.292 sq.ft.)\n\n"
      },
